  "author": "spec-seal",
  "operation": "normalize",
  "profile": "cn-n",
  "derivation": "Collab_X/Pool_X carry the support labels but no binding and non-allocator ids: N never finds a support by name and never takes over an ordinary black-box pool, so it creates a new Collaboration, main Participant and band for Process_P (OPEN-MACHINE default: create a new band when none is explicitly selected) and leaves Collab_X and Pool_X byte-identical. Ref_P has no association: placement without anchor.",
